<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>历史思维导图</title>
<style>
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  body {
    font-family: "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
    color: #222;
    background-color: #f7f7f7;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 20px;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    background-color: #fff;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 850px;
    padding: 30px 40px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  }
  .header-text {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .worksheet-box {
    position: relative;
    border: 1px solid #333;
    min-height: 750px;
    padding-top: 10px;
    background-color: #fff;
  }
  .printed-text {
    position: absolute;
    font-family: "SimSun", serif;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  .horizontal-line {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 110px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #888;
    z-index: 0;
  }
  .mindmap {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    font-family: "Kaiti", "KaiTi_GB2312", cursive;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #111;
    padding-left: 20px;
    padding-top: 40px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .branch {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .node {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    white-space: nowrap;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .brace-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    margin: 0 10px;
    min-width: 15px;
  }
  .brace-wrapper svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: visible;
  }
  .children {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 15px;
    padding: 8px 0;
  }
  .line-text {
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .indented {
    padding-left: 45px;
  }
  .indented-deep {
    padding-left: 85px;
  }
  .watermark {
    position: absolute;
    right: 40px;
    top: 55%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    text-align: center;
    z-index: 10;
    font-family: "PingFang SC", sans-serif;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .watermark .logo {
    color: white;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), -1px -1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), 1px -1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), -1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .watermark .sub {
    color: white;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-top: 4px;
    text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), -1px -1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), 1px -1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), -1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-text">
    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;学完了本课，请你以自己擅长的形式，为本课所学知识画一幅示意图，揭示<br>
    知识间的联系。可以是思维导图，也可以是结构图、漫画等。请写出你的设计意<br>
    图，让老师看得懂。
  </div>

  <div class="worksheet-box">
    <div class="printed-text" style="top: 15px; left: 10px;">作图区：</div>

    <div class="horizontal-line"></div>
    <div class="printed-text" style="bottom: 85px; left: 10px;">设计意图说明：</div>

    <div class="watermark">
      <div class="logo">🌷 LEI蕾</div>
      <div class="sub">小红书</div>
    </div>

    <div class="mindmap">
      <div class="branch">
        <div class="node" style="width: 45px; text-align: center;">明朝<br>的统治</div>
        <div class="brace-wrapper">
          <svg preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 10 100"><path d="M 9,0 Q 4,0 4,10 L 4,40 Q 4,50 0,50 Q 4,50 4,60 L 4,90 Q 4,100 9,100" fill="none" stroke="#222" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="children" style="gap: 30px;">

          <!-- Branch: 建立 -->
          <div class="branch">
            <div class="node">建立</div>
            <div class="brace-wrapper">
              <svg preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 10 100"><path d="M 9,0 Q 4,0 4,10 L 4,40 Q 4,50 0,50 Q 4,50 4,60 L 4,90 Q 4,100 9,100" fill="none" stroke="#222" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="children" style="gap: 5px;">
              <div class="line-text">时间: 1368年</div>
              <div class="line-text">建立者: 朱元璋</div>
              <div class="line-text">都城: 应天府(南京)</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Branch: 强化皇权 -->
          <div class="branch">
            <div class="node" style="width: 40px; text-align: center;">强化<br>皇权</div>
            <div class="brace-wrapper">
              <svg preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 10 100"><path d="M 9,0 Q 4,0 4,10 L 4,40 Q 4,50 0,50 Q 4,50 4,60 L 4,90 Q 4,100 9,100" fill="none" stroke="#222" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="children" style="gap: 12px;">

              <div class="branch">
                <div class="node">改革</div>
                <div class="brace-wrapper">
                  <svg preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 10 100"><path d="M 9,0 Q 4,0 4,10 L 4,40 Q 4,50 0,50 Q 4,50 4,60 L 4,90 Q 4,100 9,100" fill="none" stroke="#222" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="children" style="gap: 5px;">
                  <div class="line-text">
                    地方: 设立“三司”，分散行省的权力<br>
                    <div class="indented">分封诸子为王，驻守各地，监控地方</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="line-text">
                    中央: 废除丞相制度和中书省，设<br>
                    <div class="indented">立五军都督府。</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="line-text">
                设锦衣卫: 为监视官民，后设立了东厂，这两<br>
                <div class="indented-deep">个机构合称为“厂卫”，由皇帝直接指挥</div>
              </div>
              <div class="line-text">
                立“祖制”: 规定子子孙孙不得改变他的做法
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Branch: 科举考试 -->
          <div class="branch">
            <div class="node" style="width: 40px; text-align: center;">科举<br>考试</div>
            <div class="brace-wrapper">
              <svg preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 10 100"><path d="M 9,0 Q 4,0 4,10 L 4,40 Q 4,50 0,50 Q 4,50 4,60 L 4,90 Q 4,100 9,100" fill="none" stroke="#222" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="children" style="gap: 5px;">
              <div class="line-text">范围: “四书”“五经”</div>
              <div class="line-text">标准: 朱熹的《四书集注》</div>
              <div class="line-text">格式: 八股文</div>
              <div class="line-text">影响: 禁锢思想，成为皇帝旨意的顺从者</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Branch: 经济 -->
          <div class="branch">
            <div class="node">经济</div>
            <div class="brace-wrapper">
              <svg preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 10 100"><path d="M 9,0 Q 4,0 4,10 L 4,40 Q 4,50 0,50 Q 4,50 4,60 L 4,90 Q 4,100 9,100" fill="none" stroke="#222" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="children" style="gap: 8px;">
              <div class="line-text">农业: 引进玉米、甘薯、马铃薯、花生、向日葵等。</div>
              <div class="line-text">手工业: 棉纺织业，丝织业(苏州)，制瓷业(景德镇)</div>

              <div class="branch">
                <div class="node">商业</div>
                <div class="brace-wrapper">
                  <svg preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 10 100"><path d="M 9,0 Q 4,0 4,10 L 4,40 Q 4,50 0,50 Q 4,50 4,60 L 4,90 Q 4,100 9,100" fill="none" stroke="#222" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="children" style="gap: 5px;">
                  <div class="line-text">城市: 北京、南京等</div>
                  <div class="line-text">商帮: 晋商、徽商</div>
                </div>
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
```
